---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — PDF to Excel AI | PDF2DataAI" description="Review the terms and conditions for using PDF2DataAI's AI-powered PDF to Excel conversion service. Understand your rights and responsibilities.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
      <span class="mb-6 inline-block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-400">Terms</span>
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions</h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 1, 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using PDF2DataAI ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time, and continued use constitutes acceptance of changes.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>PDF2DataAI provides an AI-powered document extraction platform that converts PDFs, images, and other document formats into structured data such as Excel, CSV, and JSON. The Service includes per-field confidence scoring, automated data extraction via OCR and machine learning, and multi-format export capabilities.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in compliance with all applicable laws. You must not upload documents that contain illegal content, malware, or infringing material. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>You retain all ownership rights to documents you upload. PDF2DataAI claims no intellectual property rights over your content. The Service, including its AI extraction engine, confidence scoring algorithms, and user interface, is the proprietary property of PDF2DataAI and is protected by intellectual property laws.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">5. Service Limitations</h2>
        <p>While our AI document extraction engine strives for high accuracy, we do not guarantee 100% accuracy for every extraction. Confidence scores are estimates based on our AI models. Users should review flagged fields before relying on extracted data. The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">6. Free Tier and Subscriptions</h2>
        <p>The Free tier includes 10 pages per month with full confidence scoring. Pro ($19/month) includes 500 pages. Business ($49/month) includes 2,000 pages. Unused pages do not roll over to the next billing cycle. Subscriptions auto-renew unless cancelled. Refunds are provided within 14 days of purchase for annual plans.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>PDF2DataAI shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Service. Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid by you for the Service in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">8. Termination</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, engage in fraudulent activity, or abuse the Service. You may cancel your account at any time through your dashboard or by contacting support.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be resolved through binding arbitration.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-100">10. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, please contact us at support@pdf2dataai.com or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-400 underline transition-colors hover:text-brand-300">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
